      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Bike Transportation In Machhlishahr Jaunpur</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When a two‑wheeler or motorcycle arrives at the destination, the delivery handover is a structured, documented process designed to protect both the carrier and the consignee. The handover begins with a daylight visual inspection, where the driver or designated verifier compares the vehicle’s current condition with the original pickup photographs.</p>
<p>This comparison is performed in a well‑lit area to ensure that all visible damage, scratches, and paint imperfections are accurately assessed. Any discrepancies must be recorded in the handover log, and the consignee is required to acknowledge the findings before proceeding.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
